<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out as of 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out as of 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef generally firm on light to moderate demand and offerings. Select and Choice chuck, round and loin cuts generally firm, while rib cuts very uneven. Beef trimmings generally steady on light to moderate demand and offerings. -USDA</p>
